Error: Jet.UnknownFunction: `Store` has no method `live`
  --> Tests/UI/fix_points_to_the_real_api.jet:5:10
    |
  5 |     conn.live(SQL{"SELECT x FROM t"})
    |          ^^^^
 Why: `Store` is a protected Core type with a closed method surface
 Fix: `live` is on `DBScope`, which `.with_policy(…)` returns: write `.with_policy(…).live(…)`
